# Cloudflare Pages Redirect Rules
# SEO Migration: blog.infalex.com → infalex.com
# All rules are 301 Permanent Redirects

# Static page redirects
/blog https://infalex.com/blog 301
/about https://infalex.com/about 301
/contact https://infalex.com/contact 301
/privacy https://infalex.com/privacy 301
/disclaimer https://infalex.com/disclaimer 301
/rss.xml https://infalex.com/rss.xml 301

# Blog post redirects — /posts/slug → infalex.com/blog/slug
/posts/ATS-Rejection-Fix https://infalex.com/blog/ATS-Rejection-Fix 301
/posts/Best-ATS-Resume-Format https://infalex.com/blog/Best-ATS-Resume-Format 301
/posts/Top-Resume-Keywords-Recruiters-Look https://infalex.com/blog/Top-Resume-Keywords-Recruiters-Look 301
/posts/best-resume-format-bca-students-india https://infalex.com/blog/best-resume-format-bca-students-india 301
/posts/common-resume-mistakes https://infalex.com/blog/common-resume-mistakes 301
/posts/how-long-should-a-resume-be https://infalex.com/blog/how-long-should-a-resume-be 301
/posts/resume-vs-cv-difference-guide https://infalex.com/blog/resume-vs-cv-difference-guide 301
/posts/welcome-to-infalex https://infalex.com/blog/welcome-to-infalex 301

# Dynamic catch-all for any /posts/* path not listed above
/posts/* https://infalex.com/blog/:splat 301

# Dynamic catch-all for any /blog/* path
/blog/* https://infalex.com/blog/:splat 301

# Homepage redirect (must come after more specific rules)
/ https://infalex.com/blog 301

# Catch-all fallback — prevents any 404s
/* https://infalex.com 301
